  "description": "You want to ride like Chad, then try out the Chad Kerley AM. This bike is as pro as your gonna get. Full Cr-Mo Frame with investment cast dropouts and custom molded chainstays so you can slam your rear wheel to 12.75\". LHD Freecoaster. Cr-Mo Bars and Fok with Chads new Premium after market stem. This bike has been tested and approved by Chad himself. So no matter the streets or parks you take this, trust in the all new CK AM.\n100% chromoly frame with integrated head tube, tapered stay tubing with custom formed chain stays and investment cast dropouts, welded seat clamp, 20.75\" top tube length and removable brake and cable mounts\n100% chromoly fork with internal threaded 1 piece CNC steer tube, tapered legs and 5mm dropouts\n100% chromoly bars 8.75\" with Premium CK CNC alloy top load stem\nHaro branded 3-piece chromoly 8-spline 175mm cranks with Haro Team Disc 28T CNC alloy bolt drive sprocket and sealed Mid BB\nFully sealed wheels with Haro Sata double-wall alloy rims, alloy shell hubs and LSD free-coaster rear hub with 14mm male axle and 9t driver\nPremium CK tires 2.4\" front and rear\nHaro padded Tri-pod seat with alloy Tri-pod post",
